<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Login baru ke akun NEXQIA Anda</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f6f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2933;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f4f6f8;padding:24px 0;">
<tr><td align="center">
<table role="presentation" width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:560px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;">
<tr><td style="padding:20px 32px;border-bottom:3px solid #1769aa;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#1769aa;">NEXQIA</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px 32px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Halo {{.Username}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Akun NEXQIA Anda baru saja dipakai login dari perangkat yang belum pernah digunakan sebelumnya.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;">
<tr><td style="padding:4px 16px 4px 0;color:#52606d;">Waktu</td><td style="padding:4px 0;">{{.When}}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:4px 16px 4px 0;color:#52606d;">Perangkat</td><td style="padding:4px 0;">{{.Device}}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:4px 16px 4px 0;color:#52606d;">Alamat IP</td><td style="padding:4px 0;">{{.IP}}</td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Jika ini Anda, abaikan email ini.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;"><strong>Bukan Anda?</strong> Segera ganti password dan keluarkan perangkat lain.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;"><a href="{{.SecurityURL}}" style="display:inline-block;background:#1769aa;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;">Buka Keamanan Akun</a></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 32px;border-top:1px solid #e4e7eb;font-size:12px;color:#7b8794;">Email ini dikirim otomatis, mohon tidak dibalas.</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
